The Hollow is the network of caverns and tunnels that runs beneath [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. It reaches under most of the continent and can be traveled on foot, so those who know the ways cross the mountains under them rather than over. Ruins and old technology from past [[Phenomena/Althane/Cycle|cycles]] lie in it more often than on the surface, and the creatures that live in it are more dangerous than those above; they grow more common the longer one stays. One of the mountains above it is a volcano, and its lava runs in a crevasse through the Hollow about five miles wide at its narrowest. [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Vyre, the Inverted City|Vyre]] stands within it, and the [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin|lava ruin]] carries a passage across the lava.
